        "subject": "Portal plans and payment dialog; console trial wording, Owner number, approval from trial end; docs/119 generator",
        "body": "Portal plans and payment dialog; console trial wording, Owner number, approval from trial end; docs/119 generator\n\n- Portal: choose 1, 3 or 12 months (the server's per-store quote); a\n  dialog with each offered payment number and a copy button; a\n  screenshot and Confirm payment send the plan (never an amount).\n- Admin proofs: Verified / Not verified; the approval defaults to the\n  proof's months and amount.\n- Business page: \"Free trial until ...\" instead of \"Not given yet\";\n  \"the eligibility was used\" once claimed. List: the Owner's verified\n  number; a running trial's end in the Ends column. Approve during a\n  trial previews the end counted from the trial's end (no rule change).\n- test/legal-markdown.gen.test.ts renders the approved legal pages to\n  markdown (docs/119) with the build's values when GEN_LEGAL_MD is set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
